{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus is Streaming! He didn't give up, but decided to lifestream his endless struggle to find some joy in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird mixture of Streamer Simulator, Clicker and Quick-time actions about life, spectacle, and making the grind worth living. Push the boulder. Do tricks. Grow channel. Unlock new struggles. Play mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And always ask:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which boulder is yours?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you Imagine Sisyphus Happy?\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people ask, &quot;Can you win this game?&quot; You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/88567f64cf5b34f011a01aa97bef91d0.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/88567f64cf5b34f011a01aa97bef91d0.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/88567f64cf5b34f011a01aa97bef91d0.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/85ede9a6f6e0e59d8fbb3602835ef5a9.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/85ede9a6f6e0e59d8fbb3602835ef5a9.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/85ede9a6f6e0e59d8fbb3602835ef5a9.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe struggle itself toward the heights is enough to fill a human\u2019s heart. One must imagine Sisyphus happy.\u201d</i> \u2013 Albert Camus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus, king of Corinth, has tricked the Gods and Death. To punish him, the Gods condemned him to push a boulder uphill forever, only for it to roll back each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Sisyphus didn't give up! He decided to livestream his infinite struggle as a way to seek joy in a futile repetition. The Boulder is still there... But is it is till punishment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep pushing the boulder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/e43414676a02d935ed6f3549f9cae66d.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and discover new stuff in the vast skill and inventory systems:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 tricks with hundreds of skill points to spend on improving them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive tricks that help you roll stronger, perform better, recover faster and even automate your performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of stats, buffs and passive effects, like increasing your subscription rate or stamina recovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 100 boulders, each with different stats and a minigame, representing your everyday struggles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ decoration sets with thousands of possible combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ soundtracks, each with its own vibe and stat bonus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with all the items to set up a perfect scene for your perfect stunt - be it to get your subs' hard-earned donations, or to get a new skill point faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/da783c6db107417a4ed5c5542bf957df.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To entertain the chat (and yourself), besides pushing your boulder, you perform acrobatic tricks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different tricks, each with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tricks give more experience, others - more subscriptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to chain tricks to make crazy combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed tricks to entertain and excite your audience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail tricks - sometimes intentionally - to get pity donations or just for lulz</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To perform tricks, you need to play different mini-games:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ various minigames to execute your tricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games depend on the boulder you push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boulders make you type, others - play rhythm games, and some - even do some math</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to choose which boulder to push!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/d300c65cf6586cc0b5c1b1cfbf6d90ee.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/d300c65cf6586cc0b5c1b1cfbf6d90ee.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/d300c65cf6586cc0b5c1b1cfbf6d90ee.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply simulated streamer economy. What can feel better than people appreciating your performance?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain viewers from your performance, and even go viral!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert viewers into subscribers who will join your next stream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive ad revenue based on your viewers and get donations from your patrons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read chat and follow (or resist!) their demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play actively with minigames to go viral, get huge donations and maximize your growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pushing in the background to slowly grind experience and ad revenue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b905267586f4a4776bbcbd50c71ab29e.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5f9b7b959e13eecd1f656f74898071c9.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5f9b7b959e13eecd1f656f74898071c9.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5f9b7b959e13eecd1f656f74898071c9.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a meta-narrative game about spectacle and finding meaning in repetition. Roll your boulder, pull off stunts, and try to make the eternal grind worth living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressing from Greek myth to the modern day, the story asks two ultimate questions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which boulder is yours?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you Imagine Sisyphus Happy?\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So pick your boulder, and keep pushing.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Game will include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more boulders, scenes, soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaders, pets, and other ways to boost the variety of situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration - play with your real chat, or combine it with the simulated one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam workshop - can't find your very own boulder? Make it!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959020?t=1773433119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/ff70542a39cfce5dfd72d1c9373c0b16a1d3c8db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773433119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/114e2e711fd49fa65472067fab1ebd4ff135e50a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773433119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama