nlock over 100 boulders, each with different stats and a minigame, representing your everyday struggles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ decoration sets with thousands of possible combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ soundtracks, each with its own vibe and stat bonus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with all the items to set up a perfect scene for your perfect stunt - be it to get your subs' hard-earned donations, or to get a new skill point faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/da783c6db107417a4ed5c5542bf957df.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.poster.avif?t=1773433119\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.webm?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/8054ba5da51ddd46a6ad43442294cdb9.mp4?t=1773433119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To entertain the chat (and yourself), besides pushing your boulder, you perform acrobatic tricks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different tricks, each with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tricks give more experience, others - more subscriptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to chain tricks to make crazy combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed tricks to entertain and excite your audience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail tricks - sometimes in