er? Make it!</p></li></ul>","developers":["UnplayTheGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/da9e3b935ceb966f402a57785e09f1ab8b48ba08/header.jpg?t=1773433119","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 (or equivalent 64\u2011bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3\u20113220 / AMD FX\u20116300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel with Metal support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon GPU or any Metal\u2011capable Intel/AMD GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959020/84256844/1b49f8596f4d9e6617fbf7ae7ef93adbe8828980/1770317735/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770324932","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959020/84256844/1b49f8596f4d9e6617fbf7ae7ef93adbe8828980/1770317735/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770324932","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959020/84256844/1b49f8596f4d9e6617fbf7ae7ef93adbe8828980/1770317735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770324932","id":257280291,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257280291/ac71e829b82feca190953541b644a5b74298b52c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=177032493